1. 21st.dev. The layouts of the components in this repository are inspired by
   components published on https://21st.dev. The markup, CSS and SVG here were
   rewritten from scratch as static HTML/CSS; no original source files are
   redistributed. Check each original page for its own license before any
   commercial reuse of a similar layout. The inspiration list (21st.dev id,
   original name, author) follows; the same data is in the `source` field of
   each entry in CATALOG.json and in the header of each component file.
   For the pages whose license is "not stated", no license was granted to us.

